@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

participant "前端" as Frontend
participant "voimed" as Daemon
participant "pipeline worker" as Pipeline
participant "AsrBackend\n(manifest.kind)" as Asr
participant "FireRedPunc\n(可选)" as Punc

Frontend -> Daemon : Stop / VAD SpeechEnd
Daemon -> Pipeline : FinishSegment
Pipeline -> Asr : transcribe(features)
alt external punc
  Asr --> Pipeline : raw text
  Pipeline -> Punc : punctuate(text)
  Punc --> Pipeline : final text
else builtin ITN
  Asr --> Pipeline : ITN text（已含标点）
end
Pipeline --> Daemon : PipelineEvent::Final(text)
Daemon --> Frontend : Final { segment_id, text }
note over Asr
  后端由 models/active 指向的模型包决定；
  切换 = 改 active + 重启 daemon；
  不重新安装 / 编译二进制。
end note
note over Punc
  FireRed CTC 使用 external；
  SenseVoice 可选 builtin 或 external（use_itn=false）。
end note
@enduml
